# Conclusion

Modern cybersecurity depends on the ability to transform large volumes of security telemetry into meaningful insights. A Security Operations Center achieves this through continuous monitoring, detection engineering, threat hunting, investigation, and incident response.

Microsoft Sentinel provides a cloud-native platform that enables organizations to perform these activities efficiently while integrating with the broader Microsoft security ecosystem.

This handbook begins with the foundational concepts required to understand Microsoft Sentinel and progressively builds toward practical implementation, detection engineering, and real-world security operations.

